    ('PFC Esteban "Barracks Lawyer" Delgado', 'When you draw a Barracks Lawyer card, draw two and keep one. Pay double on DFAS Error.', "Has read the regulation. Not that one. A different one. From 2014. He's confident.", "Barracks lawyer: a soldier who cites regulations he hasn't finished reading.", 'shrug'),
