    ('WO1 Gus Rotorhead', 'Move one extra space on every roll. Pay $50 whenever you pass a Rotation.', 'Flies helicopters. Technically a warrant officer. Spiritually a very expensive specialist.', 'WO1: Warrant Officer 1. Outranks sergeants, salutes nobody convincingly.', 'salute'),
    ('CPT Brooke "Bullet" Fitzpatrick', 'Auctions you join open at $0 for you. Each property you win at auction gives you +1 Smoke.', 'Twenty-nine, commands 120 people, has been told she has "a lot of potential" by someone who has none.', 'CPT: Captain. The rank where you get blamed for things you were ordered to do.', 'point'),
    ('SFC Dale Fobbit', 'Never pay rent at Rotations. You may not enter Block Leave; stop one space short.', 'Has deployed four times and left the base zero times. Has a Bronze Star for a spreadsheet.', 'Fobbit: a soldier who never leaves the FOB. The FOB is the base. The Fobbit is comfortable.', 'count'),
    ('PV2 Kayla Enterprise', 'Help Desk rent is free for you. Before each turn say "Have you tried restarting it." Forgetting = +1 Smoke.', "Fixed the commander's email once. Now she is the commander's email.", 'Enterprise: the Army\'s email system. "Enterprise" is Latin for "it\'s down."', 'shrug'),
